sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as Laravel API
    participant DB as Database
    participant C as Chargily Pay v2
    U->>F: Choose a plan and click "Pay"
    F->>A: POST /api/checkout (plan, period)
    A->>A: Amount computed server-side, verified e-mail required
    A->>DB: Create a "pending" payment
    A->>C: POST /checkouts (amount, success/failure_url, metadata)
    C-->>A: { id, checkout_url }
    A->>DB: Store provider_reference
    A-->>F: { checkout_url }
    F->>C: Redirect to the payment page
    U->>C: Enter the Edahabia/CIB card + OTP
    par Webhook (server to server)
        C->>A: POST /api/webhooks/chargily (HMAC signature)
        A->>A: Verify HMAC-SHA256(body, secret key)
        A->>A: Check amount + currency
        A->>DB: markSucceeded() (idempotent) + VPN + receipt
    and Browser return
        C-->>F: Redirect /payment/result?payment=ID
        F->>A: GET /api/payments/{id}/verify
        A->>C: GET /checkouts/{id} (fallback)
        A-->>F: Final status
    end
